%% Repody — Local development architecture
%% Default path: Hub images in Docker Compose + host NuExtract (llama-server)
%% Docs: docs/LOCAL.md · CONTEXT.md
%% Commands: pnpm platform  |  Mac no-source: ./bin/repody start

flowchart TB
  %% ── Actors ──────────────────────────────────────────────
  Browser["Browser<br/>http://localhost:3000<br/>use localhost not 127.0.0.1"]

  %% ── Host machine ───────────────────────────────────────
  subgraph Host["Host machine — Windows · macOS · Linux"]
    direction TB

    subgraph HostInf["Inference on host metal — NOT in Docker"]
      Llama["llama-server :8081<br/>NuExtract3 GGUF + mmproj<br/>catalog: repody:vlm  ★ default"]
      OptPaddle["optional --with-paddle<br/>PP-OCRv6 :8868 → Qwen :8084<br/>paddleocr:qwen"]
      OptGlm["optional --with-glm<br/>GLM-OCR :8083<br/>glm:qwen"]
    end

    subgraph Docker["Docker Desktop — Compose project repody"]
      direction TB

      subgraph Edge["App images — pulled from Docker Hub<br/>mehdigououiad/repody-web · repody-backend"]
        Web["repody-web :3000<br/>Next.js + Auth.js<br/>proxies /api/v1 → api:8000"]
        API["repody-api :8000<br/>FastAPI · migrations · seed<br/>OIDC JWT validation"]
        WX["worker-extract<br/>Taskiq pool extract<br/>PDF / VLM / rules"]
        WF["worker-fast<br/>Taskiq pool fast<br/>logic-only runs"]
      end

      subgraph Data["Data plane — public images"]
        PG[("PostgreSQL :5432<br/>workflows · runs · outbox")]
        Redis[("Redis :6379<br/>Taskiq Streams · SSE · cache")]
        MinIO[("MinIO :9000<br/>audit-documents bucket")]
      end

      subgraph Auth["Auth — Compose"]
        KC["Keycloak :8080<br/>realm repody<br/>operator@repody.local"]
      end

      subgraph Obs["Observability — optional profile<br/>pnpm platform default on; --no-obs to skip"]
        Graf["Grafana :3030"]
        Loki["Loki"]
        Tempo["Tempo"]
        OTEL["OTLP collector :4318"]
        Bug["Bugsink :8090"]
      end
    end
  end

  %% ── Delivery variants (same runtime shape) ─────────────
  Pack["Same runtime shape:<br/>git + pnpm platform<br/>or Mac zip ./bin/repody<br/>no app source required"]

  %% ── Traffic ────────────────────────────────────────────
  Browser -->|"OIDC login"| KC
  Browser -->|"UI"| Web
  Pack -.-> Web
  Web -->|"Bearer JWT /api/v1/*"| API
  API -->|"JWKS"| KC

  API --> PG
  API --> Redis
  API --> MinIO
  API -->|"enqueue after outbox commit<br/>repody:audit:extract | fast"| Redis

  Redis --> WX
  Redis --> WF
  WX --> PG
  WX --> Redis
  WX --> MinIO
  WF --> PG
  WF --> Redis

  WX -->|"host.docker.internal:8081<br/>OpenAI /v1/chat/completions"| Llama
  WX -.->|"optional"| OptPaddle
  WX -.->|"optional"| OptGlm

  API -.-> OTEL
  WX -.-> OTEL
  OTEL --> Tempo
  OTEL --> Loki
  Graf --> Loki
  Graf --> Tempo
  API -.-> Bug

  classDef browser fill:#fff8e7,stroke:#b08900,color:#111
  classDef hostInf fill:#e8f4fc,stroke:#1a5f8a,color:#111
  classDef app fill:#eef6e8,stroke:#3d6b2f,color:#111
  classDef data fill:#f5f0e6,stroke:#8a6d3b,color:#111
  classDef auth fill:#f5e6f0,stroke:#6b3d5a,color:#111
  classDef obs fill:#f0f0f0,stroke:#666,color:#111
  class Browser browser
  class Llama,OptPaddle,OptGlm hostInf
  class Web,API,WX,WF app
  class PG,Redis,MinIO data
  class KC auth
  class Graf,Loki,Tempo,OTEL,Bug obs
  class Pack browser
